@startuml
!include _style.puml
title Access / privacy — проверяемые границы в текущем коде
top to bottom direction
component "Incoming request\nbody bounds / Origin / CSRF / rate limit" as Input
component "requireAuth\ncurrent active user / bearer token" as Auth
component "Resource resolved from DB\nrequest / thread / provider / attachment" as Resource
component "Client access\nresource.clientId == user.id" as Client
component "Provider access\nactive membership + permission\nlocation scope / legacy owner fallback" as Provider
component "Privileged access\nrole + exceptional reason / assignment\nзависит от конкретного entrypoint" as Admin
component "Use-case mutation / private DTO" as Result
component "Authorized object delivery\nprivate object key / short-lived access" as Object
component "Audit / security events\nбез private message bodies / raw credentials" as Audit
Input --> Auth
Auth --> Resource
Resource --> Client
Resource --> Provider
Resource --> Admin
Client --> Result
Provider --> Result
Admin --> Result
Result --> Object : attachment access rechecked
Admin --> Audit : exceptional read / moderation
note right of Provider
  Workspace permission scopes имеют provider/location семантику.
  Глобальный owner — ещё compatibility роль;
  один frontend guard не является backend authorization.
end note
note bottom of Admin
  Modern chat writer запрещает admin/superadmin private send.
  Legacy request participant guard пропускает SuperAdmin,
  поэтому request message write обходит этот запрет.
  Не переносить правила одного endpoint на другой по аналогии.
end note
note bottom of Object
  S3/private storage adapter и scan/quarantine поддержаны кодом.
  Production storage policy / KMS / MFA — отдельные acceptance gates.
end note
footer require-auth.ts / provider-access.service.ts / request-access.service.ts / chat-access.service.ts
@enduml
